  "question": {
    "text": "A telephonic communication service is working at a carrier frequency of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>GHz</mi></math>. Only <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>%</mo></math> of it is utilized for transmission. How many telephonic channels can be transmitted simultaneously if each channel requires a bandwidth of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kHz</mi></math>?"
  },
